# Normalise to LF in the index and on checkout, on every platform.
#
# This matters more than usual here: packages/*/templates/** is scaffold
# PAYLOAD that gets copied verbatim into generated projects. A contributor on
# Windows with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise check those files out as
# CRLF and scaffold apps with mixed line endings. The CLI's copy paths use raw
# copyFile / readFile+writeFile and never translate line endings, so whatever
# is on disk is what the user gets.
#
# End users installing from npm are unaffected either way — a tarball is
# extracted, not checked out, so their git config never touches it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.tgz binary
